@startuml
actor TeamMember
boundary DeliverableManagementInterface
control DeliverableController
control DeliverableService
control BadgeService
database Database
boundary NotificationService

TeamMember -> DeliverableManagementInterface: Access deliverable management page
DeliverableManagementInterface -> DeliverableController: Request existing deliverables
DeliverableController -> DeliverableService: Fetch existing deliverables
DeliverableService -> Database: Retrieve deliverables
Database --> DeliverableService: Return deliverables
DeliverableService --> DeliverableController: Return deliverables
DeliverableController --> DeliverableManagementInterface: Display existing deliverables
DeliverableManagementInterface --> TeamMember: Show existing deliverables

TeamMember -> DeliverableManagementInterface: Upload new deliverable
DeliverableManagementInterface -> DeliverableController: Submit deliverable
DeliverableController -> DeliverableService: Store deliverable
DeliverableService -> Database: Store deliverable
Database --> DeliverableService: Confirm storage
DeliverableService --> DeliverableController: Confirm submission

alt Assign Badge
    DeliverableService -> BadgeService: Assign badge for submission
    BadgeService -> Database: Update student record with badge
    Database --> BadgeService: Confirm badge assignment
    BadgeService --> DeliverableService: Confirm badge assignment
end

DeliverableController --> DeliverableManagementInterface: Confirm submission
DeliverableManagementInterface --> TeamMember: Show submission confirmation

DeliverableService -> NotificationService: Notify successful submission and badge assignment
NotificationService -> TeamMember: Send notification of successful submission and badge earned

TeamMember -> DeliverableManagementInterface: Remove deliverable
DeliverableManagementInterface -> DeliverableController: Request removal
DeliverableController -> DeliverableService: Delete deliverable
DeliverableService -> Database: Delete deliverable
Database --> DeliverableService: Confirm deletion
DeliverableService --> DeliverableController: Confirm removal
DeliverableController --> DeliverableManagementInterface: Confirm removal
DeliverableManagementInterface --> TeamMember: Show removal confirmation

DeliverableService -> NotificationService: Notify successful removal
NotificationService -> TeamMember: Send notification

@enduml
